  "job_B3.3.17.3_20251003_114702": {
    "chunk_text": "\u00fee he \u00feone d\u00e6g wisse his for\u00f0si\u00f0e, & & he \u00fea his bro\u00f0rum s\u00e6gde \u00fe\u00e6t hit \u00fea \u00e6trihte w\u00e6re \u00fe\u00e6t he of \u00feisse worulde sceolde. \u00d0a wiste he sumne hired on his bisceopscire \u00fea \u00fee unge\u00feweare & ungesybsume him betweonum \u00dea ferde he \u00feyder mid his \u00feegnum, \u00feeah \u00f0e he wiste \u00fe\u00e6t hit \u00fea \u00e6t his dea\u00f0d\u00e6ge w\u00e6re, \u00fe\u00e6t he huru \u00dea cwomon hie to sumre ea, \u00fea gesawon hie \u00feara wel feala \u00feara fugela \u00fee we scealfras nemna\u00fe, & hie \u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 sanctus Martinus: Hw\u00e6t, \u00feas wiht habba\u00f0 deofla onlicnesse, swa \u00fee deofol a s\u00e6ta\u00fe hw\u00e6r he \u00d0a bebead sanctus Martinus \u00feam fugelum \u00fe\u00e6t hie \u00feanon fram \u00feam w\u00e6tere gewiten, & on westen & & efne on \u00fea gelicnesse swa he \u00feone deoful of stowa gehwylcre geflymde \u00fe\u00e6r he \u00feonne w\u00e6s, swa \u00f0a & hie \u00fe\u00e6t wundredon \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6t gesawon & his fera w\u00e6ron \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0a fugelas sylfe eac sancte Martine \u00d0a he \u00fea h\u00e6fde \u00feone hyred gesybbodne \u00fee he \u00fe\u00e6r to ferde, & \u00fe\u00e6r well manige dagas w\u00e6s, & \u00fea he \u00f0a \u00dea het he ealle his \u00feegnas him to, & he him s\u00e6gde \u00fe\u00e6t he for\u00f0feran sceolde. \u00dea weopon hie ealle sona, & sarlice geb\u00e6rdon for heora hlaforde, & hie \u00feus cw\u00e6don to him: For hwan O\u00f0\u00f0e hwam bebeodest \u00f0",
